      "side": 1,
      "message": "I just realized I accidentally made this extensible upstream. It doesn\u0027t need to be extensible because it just returns a list every time. That was the design I had written down.\n\nThe GetFeatures methods also change to not return a status.\n\nhttps://github.com/webgpu-native/webgpu-headers/pull/382\n\nSorry for my mistake!",
