      "writtenOn": "2024-10-29T08:17:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve changed it to not return a status BUT if I remove the `\"extensible\": \"out\"` line, it has no FreeMembers function anymore which is required for calling `mProcs.supportedFeaturesFreeMembers(supportedFeatures)` in dawn wire server. See https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/generator/dawn_json_generator.py;l\u003d339;drc\u003dc5f706b42e0c062aa572255240093f1f065f2a79\n\nAdding the following does not help either:\n```\n        \"methods\": [\n            {\n                \"name\": \"free members\",\n                \"returns\": \"void\",\n                \"args\": []\n            }\n        ]\n```",
      "parentUuid": "2271690b_1fd82ea9",
      "revId": "c4e4d2b0c9e9fdd83c37c56518c8c83f2c3a338f",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
