      "message": "I wish I could do `cmd.features \u003d \u0026supportedFeatures` but as you can see in try bots from https://dawn-review.googlesource.com/c/dawn/+/212754, I get the following errors:\n\n```\nReceived signal 11 SEGV_ACCERR aaaaaaaaaaaaaab2\n0   libbase.dylib                       0x000000010f0daa38 base::debug::CollectStackTrace(base::span\u003cvoid const*, 18446744073709551615ul, void const**\u003e) + 84\n1   libbase.dylib                       0x000000010f08523c base::debug::StackTrace::StackTrace(unsigned long) + 156\n2   libbase.dylib                       0x000000010f0852e4 base::debug::StackTrace::StackTrace(unsigned long) + 36\n3   libbase.dylib                       0x000000010f0852b0 base::debug::StackTrace::StackTrace() + 40\n4   libbase.dylib                       0x000000010f0da878 base::debug::(anonymous namespace)::StackDumpSignalHandler(int, __siginfo*, void*) + 1352\n5   libsystem_platform.dylib            0x000000019ff5a584 _sigtramp + 56\n6   libdawn_wire.dylib                  0x0000000110d25e74 dawn::wire::(anonymous namespace)::WGPUSupportedFeaturesGetExtraRequiredSize(WGPUSupportedFeatures const\u0026) + 64\n7   libdawn_wire.dylib                  0x0000000110d25e74 dawn::wire::(anonymous namespace)::WGPUSupportedFeaturesGetExtraRequiredSize(WGPUSupportedFeatures const\u0026) + 64\n8   libdawn_wire.dylib                  0x0000000110cf157c dawn::wire::(anonymous namespace)::ReturnInstanceRequestAdapterCallbackGetExtraRequiredSize(dawn::wire::ReturnInstanceRequestAdapterCallbackCmd const\u0026) + 804\n9   libdawn_wire.dylib                  0x0000000110cf122c dawn::wire::ReturnInstanceRequestAdapterCallbackCmd::GetRequiredSize() const + 44\n```",
      "revId": "c4e4d2b0c9e9fdd83c37c56518c8c83f2c3a338f",
